 "reduction": [
  "auto-advance.jsonl is a byte copy of the run's ledger (ledger_sha256 is both files' hash)",
  "transcript.jsonl keeps every type:user record, the type:assistant records that carry a Skill tool_use, and the type:attachment records whose attachment.type is queued_command",
  "kept fields: type, timestamp, isMeta and isSidechain (only when true), origin.kind, toolUseResult (as true), message.content block types, input.skill for a Skill tool_use, and attachment.type",
  "all text is dropped: string content becomes an empty string; Skill args, tool inputs, results and every other field are removed",
  "transcript_sha256 is the reduced file's hash; source_transcript_sha256 the original's"
 ],
 "source": "the auto-advance ledger and the Claude Code transcript of each hm run of the 2026-10-15 eval re-run (harness d25e6bb); t12-hm-2 has no ledger and is not a fixture"
}
